  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ce_note",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -420
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "CAMERA EMBERS\n\nStep in front of the camera and you are made of embers. The bright parts of the picture (your face, a lit wall, a white shirt) glow with the most sparks; the dark parts stay empty. The embers rise, drift on a gentle breeze and burn out.\n\nFlip the switch on the left and let Floret use your camera. Until then (or if there is no camera) a swaying glow stands in for you, so the sample always shows something.\n\nThe slider sets how many embers appear every second. Light yourself from the front for the clearest outline; for a different look, switch the room light off and wave a torch.\n\nTry: make the Scatter's gamma higher so only the very brightest spots glow, or turn its invert off to make embers from the dark parts instead.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 330
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "CAMERA EMBERS\n\nStep in front of the camera and you are made of embers. The bright parts of the picture (your face, a lit wall, a white shirt) glow with the most sparks; the dark parts stay empty. The embers rise, drift on a gentle breeze and burn out.\n\nFlip the switch on the left and let Floret use your camera. Until then (or if there is no camera) a swaying glow stands in for you, so the sample always shows something.\n\nThe slider sets how many embers appear every second. Light yourself from the front for the clearest outline; for a different look, switch the room light off and wave a torch.\n\nTry: make the Scatter's gamma higher so only the very brightest spots glow, or turn its invert off to make embers from the dark parts instead.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 330
      }
    },
